": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6YkAqj_uPo4Q7kNvwEMF2Ez&_nc_oc=AdoyMQs6oqqPUZqd8qs-o8Pi50ZYrUWlm7TOid91fJfwkdgWco2t1QM1p1363THbpj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI4s_5DOBOpYoBW5rOkMGzOn7jB2wylYMjsdPkphrzwMA&oe=6AA29D5B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bYk9YO1pyvIQ7kNvwE_SaI_&_nc_oc=Adp8d_7CRXun2uA9iwgsReMsgkSU4pZ3eyYzGUEwhjaoo-16Kdq1Nt4D1FenKLa-QFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIpTD_Vs-2yxcHDv5Wg84o5lYe9W521sZcpzVd5gGorUw&oe=6AA2C5E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nYcvFDXvX6UQ7kNvwEvmj_b&_nc_oc=Adq-0lf1V-ZMJW5DhnvbcaTPGjxScXu202EZZyaAHLn0-fqQxKQyLiLAkktHyzRQc0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI4WLRpuCzd10ggtlrzvnrbktXLzr8IhrvhFxz8wtYXfA&oe=6AA2B2AF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hG03Q1vXrBgQ7kNvwEyKLqP&_nc_oc=AdpEwDP4ohx3UpN4_-oG7fFfQwgOkIx-__5SaGkGeFKh90vYo60aygcSTDMp4a9QYnI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKiTNMD5UeTSIq8SJPTTM6pDz74ivbk6Sf4Ba8IRSiy4Q&oe=6AA2B252"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lob4OA0KHQ4Q7kNvwHTMGdE&_nc_oc=Ado6_SD303bBfSICzHxvYJWW4kU9BXjokdC5yZX8edR8dy1Tw18SpMAXKoczlpG6vZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLxQk3P5N5HWoOSbckmi6y5i_NEdvWWvj0I6O9wwTpiEA&oe=6AA2BBFD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a